The first link of a body's loader chain is the step's own directory. Both the step directory and
the playbook directory carry a `note.md`; the bare name resolves to the step's copy.

-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-inc-step-dir/playbook.md --
---
name: fx-inc-step-dir
title: Include Step Dir
summary: Bare include resolved from the step directory.
jinja: true
---

Preamble.
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-inc-step-dir/playbook.yaml --
graph:
  one: []
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-inc-step-dir/note.md --
PLAYBOOK-DIR-NOTE
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-inc-step-dir/one/note.md --
STEP-DIR-NOTE
-- fixtures/home/Claude/_playbooks/fx-inc-step-dir/one/prompt.md --
---
name: one
summary: Only step.
detached: sonnet:medium
---

Body says: {% include "note.md" %}
-- cmd --
booping render-playbook fx-inc-step-dir --step one
